#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information on IBM Quantum hardware and features of different processors"
msgstr "Impormasyon tungkol sa IBM Quantum hardware at mga katangian ng iba't ibang processor"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types"
msgstr "Mga uri ng processor"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types {#processor-types}"
msgstr "Mga uri ng processor {#processor-types}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types are named for the general technology qualities that go into builds, consisting of the family and revision. Family (for example, Heron) refers to the size and scale of circuits possible on the chip. This is primarily determined by the number of qubits and the connectivity graph. Revisions (for example, r3) are design variants within a given family, often leading to performance improvements or tradeoffs.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga uri ng processor ay pinangalanan batay sa pangkalahatang kalidad ng teknolohiya na ginagamit sa pagbuo, na binubuo ng pamilya at rebisyon. Ang pamilya (halimbawa, Heron) ay tumutukoy sa laki at sukat ng mga circuit na posible sa chip. Pangunahing tinutukoy ito ng bilang ng mga qubit at ng connectivity graph. Ang mga rebisyon (halimbawa, r3) ay mga variant ng disenyo sa loob ng isang partikular na pamilya, na madalas na nagdudulot ng mga pagpapabuti sa performance o mga tradeoff.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Supported instruction set\">\n"
"To find the supported instruction set for a backend, use [this code](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). You can see all supported instructions in [this table](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Sinusuportahang instruction set\">\n"
"Para mahanap ang sinusuportahang instruction set ng isang backend, gamitin ang [code na ito](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). Makikita ang lahat ng sinusuportahang instruksyon sa [talahanayan na ito](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As new processor families are added, older families are retired.  See the [Retired processor families](retired-qpus#families) section to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Habang idinadagdag ang mga bagong pamilya ng processor, ang mga lumang pamilya ay ire-retire. Tingnan ang seksyong [Mga retiradong pamilya ng processor](retired-qpus#families) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"
msgstr "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Nighthawk processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Nighthawk processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a grid topology, Nighthawk leverages our technology stack from Heron (couplers, signal delivery, and coherence) with increased connectivity for enhanced application workloads.\n"
msgstr "Sa pamamagitan ng grid topology, ginagamit ng Nighthawk ang aming technology stack mula sa Heron (mga coupler, paghahatid ng signal, at coherence) na may mas mataas na connectivity para sa mas pinahusay na mga application workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Nighthawk processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"
msgstr "[Tingnan ang mga available na Nighthawk processor](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisions\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Mga Rebisyon\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r2` (September 2026) The second version of Nighthawk, with 120 programmable qubits and 458 physical qubits, including a high speed reset on each qubit which significantly increases the maximum number of circuits per second.\n"
msgstr "`r2` (September 2026) Ang pangalawang bersyon ng Nighthawk, na may 120 programmable qubits at 458 physical qubits, kabilang ang isang mataas na bilis na reset sa bawat qubit na malaki ang naidaragdag sa maximum na bilang ng mga circuit kada segundo.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r1` (December 2025) The first version of Nighthawk, with 120 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Disyembre 2025) Ang unang bersyon ng Nighthawk, na may 120 qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heron {#heron}"
msgstr "Heron {#heron}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Heron processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Heron processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At 156 qubits, Heron is an Eagle-sized upgrade to Egret that pulls in substantial innovations in signal delivery that were previously deployed in Osprey. The signals required to enable the fast, high-fidelity two-qubit and single-qubit control are delivered with high-density flex cabling.\n"
msgstr "Sa 156 qubit, ang Heron ay isang Eagle-sized na upgrade sa Egret na nagdadala ng mahahalagang inobasyon sa paghahatid ng signal na dati nang ginagamit sa Osprey. Ang mga signal na kailangan para sa mabilis at mataas na fidelity na kontrol sa two-qubit at single-qubit ay inihahain gamit ang high-density flex cabling.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Heron processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"
msgstr "[Tingnan ang mga available na Heron processor](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisions\">\n"
"  `r3` (July 2025) Heron r3 is the result of targeted manufacturing improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Mga Rebisyon\">\n"
"  `r3` (Hulyo 2025) Ang Heron r3 ay resulta ng mga naka-target na pagpapabuti sa pagmamanupaktura na direktang nakakaapekto sa coherence, gate fidelity, at readout performance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r2` (July 2024) This is a revision of the original Heron processor. The chip has been redesigned to include 156 qubits in a heavy-hexagonal lattice. While continuing to make use of the innovations of the original Heron processors, it also introduces a new TLS mitigation feature that controls the TLS environment of the chip, thereby improving coherence and stability across the whole chip.\n"
msgstr "  `r2` (Hulyo 2024) Ito ay isang rebisyon ng orihinal na Heron processor. Ang chip ay muling idinisenyo upang magsama ng 156 qubit sa isang heavy-hexagonal lattice. Habang patuloy na ginagamit ang mga inobasyon ng mga orihinal na Heron processor, nagpapakilala rin ito ng bagong TLS mitigation feature na kumokontrol sa TLS environment ng chip, na nagpapabuti ng coherence at katatagan sa buong chip.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r1` (December 2023) The first version of Heron with 133 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Disyembre 2023) Ang unang bersyon ng Heron na may 133 qubit.\n"
